ct-defined method, path, parameters, and request body."},{"given":"A client calls a protected operation without valid authentication or without contract-required authorization.","id":"AC-REQ-1.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is the contract-declared 401 or 403, as applicable, and no undeclared role rule denies an otherwise authorized request.","when":"The client calls that operation."},{"given":"The API host is running.","id":"AC-REQ-1.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 404 for an undefined path or 405 for an unsupported method, and no feedlot product screen is displayed.","when":"A client requests an undefined path such as /api/yard or /yard, or uses an unsupported method for a contract path such as POST /api/dashboard."}],"ears":"The Feedlot API shall implement every path, HTTP method, parameter, request and response schema, status code, and security rule declared in contracts/openapi.yaml, expose no undocumented API operations, and provide no feedlot product-screen routes or rendered screens.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-5","Q-1","Q-2"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A client has valid sign-in credentials and no bearer token.","id":"AC-REQ-2.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains the contract-defined accessToken and user fields, including declared permissions and authorizedYards.","when":"The client sends POST /api/auth/sign-in with the contract SignInRequest body."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token.","id":"AC-REQ-2.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response user field contains the current user and contract-defined permissions.","when":"The client sends GET /api/session."},{"given":"Authorized dashboard data and a valid rankBy value of fcr, adg, or costOfGain are available.","id":"AC-REQ-2.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response rankingMeasure, bestLots, and worstLots correspond to the selected measure.","when":"The client sends GET /api/dashboard with the selected rankBy value."},{"given":"Lots have distinct pen, breed, sex, and status values and the client has a valid bearer token.","id":"AC-REQ-2.4","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response lots list contains only rows matching the supplied filters and contract-defined fields.","when":"The client sends GET /api/lots with supported query filters."}],"ears":"When an authorized client requests sign-in, session, dashboard, or lot-list operations, the Feedlot API shall return the contract-defined authentication, current-user, dashboard, and filtered lot values.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-1"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and the source adapter is available.","id":"AC-REQ-3.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response records field is a list of available procurement and receiving records.","when":"The client sends GET /api/imports/source-records."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ImportRequest selecting source records.","id":"AC-REQ-3.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains status, createdCount, updatedCount, records, and allocationConflicts fields reflecting the selected records and current matches.","when":"The client sends POST /api/imports."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and valid PO-line-to-lot and lot-to-pen allocation quantities.","id":"AC-REQ-3.3","level":"api","then":"Both response statuses are 200 and the response poLines, lotPens, and pens contain the saved quantities, traceability status, and capacity information.","when":"The client calls PUT /api/allocations and then GET /api/allocations."},{"given":"A client submits an invalid selection, conflicting import, or allocation that violates saved state.","id":"AC-REQ-3.4","level":"api","then":"The response status and error response match the operation's declared 409 or 422 contract.","when":"The client submits the relevant import or allocation request."}],"ears":"When an authorized client previews or imports procurement records or saves allocations, the Feedlot API shall return and persist contract-defined PO-line-to-lot and lot-to-pen traceability, including import matching and allocation-conflict results.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-1"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists.","id":"AC-REQ-4.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains the lot forecast values, forecastBasis, and effective yard and lot assumptions.","when":"The client sends GET /api/lots/{lotId}/forecast."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ForecastSettingsRequest.","id":"AC-REQ-4.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains persisted setting values; a subsequent forecast response contains the effective assumptions and projectedMarketDate declared by the contract.","when":"The client sends PATCH /api/forecast-settings or PATCH /api/lots/{lotId}/forecast-settings for an existing lot."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists with feeding and weight records where applicable.","id":"AC-REQ-4.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains contract-defined metrics or suggestions with their basis, including null unavailable metric values where applicable.","when":"The client sends GET /api/lots/{lotId}/metrics or GET /api/lots/{lotId}/insights."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing lot, and a valid planner-selected insight action or WeightMeasurementRequest.","id":"AC-REQ-4.4","level":"api","then":"The response status and response fields match the contract, and the returned action or measurement is present in the subsequent relevant response.","when":"The client sends POST /api/lots/{lotId}/insights/actions, GET /api/lots/{lotId}/weights, or POST /api/lots/{lotId}/weights as applicable."},{"given":"A client submits a weight measurement that fails contract validation, or requests forecast data or settings for a nonexistent lot.","id":"AC-REQ-4.5","level":"api","then":"The response status is the contract-declared 422 with VALIDATION_ERROR for invalid measurement data or 404 with NOT_FOUND for a nonexistent lot.","when":"The client sends the applicable weight, forecast, or forecast-settings request."}],"ears":"When an authorized client requests lot forecasts, forecast-setting updates, metrics, insights, planner actions, or weight-history operations, the Feedlot API shall return contract-defined values, calculations, explainable suggestions, and persisted updates.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-1"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and inventory items or movements exist, or the inventory is empty.","id":"AC-REQ-5.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains operationalTotals, items, movements, and contract-defined stock fields.","when":"The client sends GET /api/inventory."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid InventoryItemRequest for creation or update.","id":"AC-REQ-5.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 for creation or 200 for update and the response item contains the saved contract fields and stock values.","when":"The client sends POST /api/inventory/items or PATCH /api/inventory/items/{itemId}."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid receipt or adjustment InventoryMovementRequest for an existing item.","id":"AC-REQ-5.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the response contains the saved movement and item with updated stock values.","when":"The client sends POST /api/inventory/movements."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token, a supported horizon, and inventory with applicable plans and wastage settings.","id":"AC-REQ-5.4","level":"api","then":"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the selected horizon, projection rows with projected consumption and balance, and movement distinctions.","when":"The client sends GET /api/inventory/projections separately for daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semiAnnual, and annual horizons."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits an inventory request that fails contract validation or a projection horizon outside the contract enum.","id":"AC-REQ-5.5","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422 and the response error code is VALIDATION_ERROR.","when":"The client sends the applicable inventory write or projection request."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and authorized operational inventory rows exist.","id":"AC-REQ-5.6","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains fileName, contentType text/csv, and a Base64 CSV file derived from operational records.","when":"The client sends GET /api/inventory/export."}],"ears":"When an authorized client reads or changes inventory, the Feedlot API shall return contract-defined stock, movement, projection, and export values and persist valid inventory changes in PostgreSQL.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-2","Q-1"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and saved ration definitions exist, or the ration collection is empty.","id":"AC-REQ-6.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response rations list contains saved ingredient, proportion, nutrition, cost, and approval fields.","when":"The client sends GET /api/rations."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid RationRequest for creation or revision.","id":"AC-REQ-6.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 for creation or 200 for revision and the response ration contains the persisted definition and calculated contract fields, including costPerPound where declared.","when":"The client sends POST /api/rations or PATCH /api/rations/{rationId}."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ration optimization request with candidate mixes and nutrition requirements.","id":"AC-REQ-6.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains the contract optimization result and cost comparison, including the lowest-cost qualifying candidate or qualifyingMixFound=false as applicable.","when":"The client sends POST /api/rations/optimization."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested ration exists in a state eligible for approval.","id":"AC-REQ-6.4","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains the rationId and updated approvalStatus, which is Approved where specified by the contract.","when":"The client sends POST /api/rations/{rationId}/approval."}],"ears":"When an authorized client reads, creates, revises, optimizes, or approves a ration, the Feedlot API shall return contract-defined ration data and optimization or approval results and persist valid ration changes.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-1"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and saved feed plans exist, or the plan collection is empty.","id":"AC-REQ-7.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response plans list contains saved plan details, execution state, and audit-related fields.","when":"The client sends GET /api/feed-plans."},{"given":"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedPlanRequest with dated pen, ration, bunk rate, and animal-count values.","id":"AC-REQ-7.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the response plan contains calculated planned quantity, quantity per animal, total feed cost, expected energy intake, and status fields.","when":"The client sends POST /api/feed-plans."},